Cell["\<\
Fit function: exponentially damped cosine
Note: for this fit, y-axis offset IS a free parameter
Fit parameters:
A: amplitude
\[Omega]: oscillation/fringe frequency
\[Tau]: decay constant
t0: initial time/phase offset
C0: y-axis offset\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9692994783365016`*^9, 3.9692994917518682`*^9}, {
  3.9692995308875313`*^9, 3.9692995711526413`*^9}, {3.9698090116986833`*^9, 
